A--></div>\n<div class=\"ent-desc\">德国柏林的护理数字化 SaaS 厂商。核心产品 alea 系统：基于传感夹+IoT+AI，实时监测失禁状态、跌倒与体位并自动生成护理记录，已获 CE 医疗器械认证，服务多家养老院。B2B 护理机构软件。</div>\n<div class=\"ent-reco\"><span class=\"reco-label\">💡 推荐理由</span>围绕养老软件展开，国内养老信息化系统碎片化、机构间数据难打通亮点在把单点能力连成可复用的服务闭环，国内做同类可参考其黏性与交付设计。</div>\n<div class=\"ent-meta\"><span class=\"meta-item meta-fund\">510万美元 (2016年)</span> <span class=\"meta-item meta-fund-total\">€520万 (2025)</span> <span class=\"meta-item meta-payor\">B端机构采购/政府买单</span> <span class=\"meta-item\">成立: 2019</span> <span class=\"meta-links\"><a href=\"https://www.crunchbase.com/textsearch?q=AssistMe\" class=\"ent-link\" onclick=\"return openBg(this.href)\" title=\"在新标签页打开 Crunchbase\">Crunchbase</a> · <a href=\"https://www.assistme.com\" class=\"ent-link\" onclick=\"return openBg(this.href)\" title=\"在新标签页打开官网\">官网</a></span></div>"},{"i":"ent-e3e0f9d485","s":"#0635","r":"2","c":"比利时","g":"文娱社交","l":"邻里社交","t":"邻里社交","u":"1","v":"48.0","k":"better coliving 文娱社交 比利时","h":"<div class=\"ent-header\"><span class=\"ent-name\">Better Coliving</span> <span class=\"ent-tags\"><span class=\"ent-tag\">邻里社交</span></span> <span class=\"badge-rv s-mid\" title=\"信号10 · 信息50 · 差异75 · 复制75\">48</span> <!--A--></div>\n<div class=\"ent-desc\">被称为&#x27;老年版Airbnb&#x27;，把长者与同龄人或房东做房源共享，以较低成本换陪伴与同住，差异化在&#x27;互助居住抗孤独&#x27;。</div>\n<div class=\"ent-reco\"><span class=\"reco-label\">💡 推荐理由</span>它把长者与同龄人或房东做房源共享，用较低成本换陪伴与同住，这种互助居住的错位打法有特色。可挖其匹配机制与同住满意度的案例。国内共比邻可对标其共享居住抗孤独的思路，给做银发互助社区的创业者以启示。</div>\n<div class=\"ent-meta\"><span class=\"meta-item meta-payor\">B端机构采购+政府付费</span> <span class=\"meta-item\">成立: 2021</span> <span class=\"meta-links\"><a href=\"https://www.crunchbase.com/textsearch?q=Better%20Coliving\" class=\"ent-link\" onclick=\"return openBg(this.href)\" title=\"在新标签页打开 Crunchbase\">Crunchbase</a> · <a href=\"https://www.bettercoliving.com\" class=\"ent-link\" onclick=\"return openBg(this.href)\" title=\"在新标签页打开官网\">官网</a></span></div>"},{"i":"ent-2fdd164452","s":"#0636","